//      on every call within a process (needed by findVarInFrame's lookup).
//   2. Readable PRINTNAME: sym->data must be a CHARSXP node so that
//      CHAR(PRINTNAME(sym)) works on the error path in compat_getVar:24.
//
// Both requirements are satisfied by either:
//   (A) Thread-local hash-map symbol cache (preferred — no Python registration
//       required; works out of the box for standard rpart use)
//   (B) Python function pointer bridge (optional — Python calls
